sters-2021-09-10","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/sisters-2021-09-10#:~:text=Sinnia%20had%20replaced%20Leinore,eyes%20of%20the%20festivalgoers.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Sisters\" by Eugenia Triantafyllou. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 10 Sep 2021."}},{"id":"sisters-2021-09-10-e7","era":null,"summary":"Katilda offers Sinnia a coven headpiece in exchange for the mask, and Sinnia laughs in her face.","participants":["katilda","sinnia"],"location":"celestus","importance":"minor","page":"stories/sisters-2021-09-10","order":752,"story_date":"2021-09-10","storyline":"Innistrad: Crimson Vow","source":"wizards","paragraph":90,"quote":"But Sinnia laughed in Katilda's face and turned away.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/sisters-2021-09-10#:~:text=But%20Sinnia%20laughed%20in,face%20and%20turned%20away.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Sisters","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Eugenia Triantafyllou"],"date":"2021-09-10","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/sisters-2021-09-10","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/sisters-2021-09-10#:~:text=But%20Sinnia%20laughed%20in,face%20and%20turned%20away.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Sisters\" by Eugenia Triantafyllou. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 10 Sep 2021."}},{"id":"sisters-2021-09-10-e8","era":null,"summary":"Leinore pretends to sleep and then follows Sinnia into the forest at night.","participants":["leinore","sinnia"],"location":"ulvenwald","importance":"minor","page":"stories/sisters-2021-09-10","order":752,"story_date":"2021-09-10","storyline":"Innistrad: Crimson Vow","source":"wizards","paragraph":93,"quote":"Leinore followed Sinnia into the night.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/sisters-2021-09-10#:~:text=Leinore%20followed%20Sinnia%20into%20the%20night.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the C